ck (#0A0A0C) shadow wells, Crisp White (#FFFFFF) text, Muted Platinum (#E2E2E8) accents, Studio Slate (#141418), and colors: #FCE7F3 pastel pink highlighter bar, #DCFCE7 pastel lime green, #BAE6FD pastel blue\n• Stickers & Decals: Playful floating 3D micro-stickers and icons: glossy red cherries 🍒, disco ball 🪩, lightning bolt ⚡, flying cash 💸, retro pixel mouse cursors 🖱️, and speech bubble cards.\n• Metadata & Framing: Integrate \"// project\\ciel · AUTEUR DIRECTING\", \"[CIEL · 2026]\", and header/nav style: Minimalist top app navigation: \"< project\\ciel.\" on top-left, \"☰ 🔍 +\" icons on top-right in black.\n\n=== [SLIDE 1 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 1 of 8 (HOOK)\nCard Counter Tag: \"01 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"HIGGSFIELD CINEMA SPEC\"\nMain Headline: \"how to direct 4k product videos with real fluid physics.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"4k product videos, fluid physics\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"Stop making stiff robot AI videos. Here is how to add weight, bounce, and cinematic motion.\"\nBottom Prompt: \"SWIPE FOR CAMERA MOVES →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.\n\n=== [SELF-CHECKER STRICT FIDELITY ENFORCEMENT] ===\nMandatory Reference Visual Signatures: Ensure the output strictly incorporates: pill tag.\nDo not deviate from the reference image's visual composition and materials.",
